<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Rootbind</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

Living roots weave through the belt, anchoring the wearer to the
earth's endurance.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Recipe ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 5)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Target:</ansi>      belt (must be equipped)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> binding paste (x2), healers root (x1)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Time:</ansi>        3 rounds
  <ansi fg="yellow">Reserve:</ansi>     health (1% at tier 0, scaling with tier)

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Effect ━━━</ansi>

Increases vitality.

The enchantment grows stronger through combat use, advancing
through five tiers of increasing power and reserve cost.

